{"name":"统计数值","description":"在首页或数据看板上突出显示人数、金额、比例等关键数字 · 例如“本周订单 486，较上周增加 12%”同时告诉用户数值和比较对象。只写“↑12%”却不说明和谁相比，会让结果失去意义。","quote":"首页要几个特别大的数字，比如用户数、成交额。","agentPrompt":"请把本周订单做成统计数值：主值显示 486 笔，辅助信息明确“较上周增加 12%”。不要只显示箭头或百分比；同时处理无上周数据、下降和数据更新时间三种情况。","html":"<div class=\"detail-body detail-entry-statistic\"><section class=\"detail-hero\" id=\"detail-hero\"><div class=\"dh-head\"><h1>统计数值<span>Statistic</span></h1></div><div class=\"dh-quote\"><span class=\"dh-quote-label\">你可能会说</span><p class=\"dh-quote-text\">首页要几个特别大的数字，比如用户数、成交额。</p></div><div class=\"dh-tagline\"><strong class=\"dh-summary-lead\">在首页或数据看板上突出显示人数、金额、比例等关键数字</strong><span class=\"dh-summary-separator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>例如“本周订单 486，较上周增加 12%”同时告诉用户数值和比较对象。只写“↑12%”却不说明和谁相比，会让结果失去意义。</span></div><div class=\"dh-demo\"><div class=\"dh-demo-viewport\"><div class=\"dh-demo-inner\"><span class=\"stat-d\"><span class=\"s-label\">本月销售额</span><span class=\"s-value\">¥ 864,000</span><span class=\"s-trend up\">↑ 12.5%</span></span>\n  <span class=\"stat-d\"><span class=\"s-label\">活跃用户</span><span class=\"s-value\">12,846</span><span class=\"s-trend up\">↑ 8.3%</span></span>\n  <span class=\"stat-d\"><span class=\"s-label\">当前在线</span><span class=\"s-value\">3,872<small>人</small></span><span class=\"s-trend down\">↓ 2.1%</span></span></div></div></div></section><div class=\"lesson-extras\"><section class=\"lesson-agent-prompt\" aria-labelledby=\"lesson-agent-title\"><h2 id=\"lesson-agent-title\">你可以这样告诉 AI Agent</h2><blockquote><span class=\"lesson-agent-quote\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span><p>请把本周订单做成统计数值：主值显示 486 笔，辅助信息明确“较上周增加 12%”。不要只显示箭头或百分比；同时处理无上周数据、下降和数据更新时间三种情况。</p></blockquote></section></div><div class=\"usage-grid\"><div class=\"usage-box use\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.2 4.2L19 7\"></path></svg></span>什么时候用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>仪表盘核心指标</b>：销售额、活跃用户</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-row \"><div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"flex:1;min-width:128px;width:auto;gap:3px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">活跃用户</span><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);line-height:1.3\">12,846</span></div><div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"flex:1;min-width:128px;width:auto;gap:3px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">销售额</span><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);line-height:1.3\">¥ 86.4w</span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">带<b>涨跌趋势</b>，对比当前值与基准期</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-row \"><div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"flex:1;min-width:124px;width:auto;gap:2px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">本周新增</span><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);line-height:1.3\">1,024</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--green);font-weight:600\">↑ 12.5%</span></div><div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"flex:1;min-width:124px;width:auto;gap:2px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">流失率</span><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);line-height:1.3\">2.1%</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red);font-weight:600\">↓ 0.4%</span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>实时数据</b>：在线人数、秒杀倒计时</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"color:var(--text-2)\">当前在线</span><span style=\"flex:1\"></span><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:var(--brand)\">3,872</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">人</span></div><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"color:var(--text-2)\">距秒杀结束</span><span style=\"flex:1\"></span><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:var(--red)\">00:12:46</span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>卡片里</b>的辅助小指标</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text)\">本月总结</span><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"color:var(--text-2)\">完成任务</span><span style=\"flex:1\"></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:var(--text)\">47</span></div><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"color:var(--text-2)\">获得好评</span><span style=\"flex:1\"></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:var(--text)\">98%</span></div></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"usage-box dont\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7l10 10M17 7 7 17\"></path></svg></span>什么时候不用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">展示<b>任务不需要的精度</b>，会增加理解负担</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">转化率</span><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text)\">23.4782%</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);line-height:1.5\">展示了不必要的小数位，反而影响快速理解</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>同一区域展示过多大数字</b>，会削弱重点</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:1px;padding:0 4px\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text)\">12,846</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">指标</span></span><span style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:1px;padding:0 4px\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text)\">86.4w</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">指标</span></span><span style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:1px;padding:0 4px\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text)\">3,872</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">指标</span></span><span style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:1px;padding:0 4px\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text)\">47</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">指标</span></span><span style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:1px;padding:0 4px\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text)\">98%</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">指标</span></span><span style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:1px;padding:0 4px\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text)\">2.1%</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">指标</span></span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">表达<b>完成进度</b>：使用 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/progress?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"progress\" aria-label=\"进度条 Progress\">进度条 <b>Progress</b></a></div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row between\"><span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">存储空间</span><span style=\"flex:1\"></span><span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">6.6 / 10 GB</span></div><span class=\"mk-progress \" style=\"width:100%\"><i style=\"width:66%\"></i></span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">用户需要<b>状态结论</b>而非数字：使用 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/tag?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"tag\" aria-label=\"标签 Tag\">标签 <b>Tag</b></a></div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"color:var(--text-2)\">服务可用性</span><span style=\"flex:1\"></span><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text)\">99.95%</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);line-height:1.5\">用户只想知道“正常”还是“故障”</span></div></div></li></ul></div></div><section><div class=\"section-title\">组成结构 · Anatomy</div><div class=\"anat-wrap\"><div class=\"anat-stage\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"root\"><span class=\"stat-d\">\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"label\"><span class=\"s-label\">本月活跃用户</span></span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"value\"><span class=\"s-value\">12,846</span></span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"trend\"><span class=\"s-trend up\">↑ 12.5% 较上月</span></span>\n    </span></span></div><div class=\"anat-parts\"><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"root\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">1</span><span class=\"pn\">统计数值</span><span class=\"pe\">Statistic</span></button><span class=\"pd\">标题 + 大数字 + 趋势的组合</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"label\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">2</span><span class=\"pn\">指标名</span><span class=\"pe\">Label</span></button><span class=\"pd\">说明这是什么指标</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"value\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">3</span><span class=\"pn\">数值</span><span class=\"pe\">Value</span></button><span class=\"pd\">视觉焦点，放大加粗</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"trend\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">4</span><span class=\"pn\">趋势</span><span class=\"pe\">Trend</span></button><span class=\"pd\">用数值、方向符号和文字说明相对上期的变化，颜色只作辅助；金融场景还要遵循当地颜色约定</span></div></div></div></section><section><div class=\"section-title\">常见变体 · Variants</div><div class=\"variant-grid\"><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">基础数值<span>Basic</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><span class=\"stat-d\"><span class=\"s-label\">文章总数</span><span class=\"s-value\">1,024</span></span></div><div class=\"variant-when\">只需展示当前值，不需要比较趋势时</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">带趋势<span>Trend</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><span class=\"stat-d\"><span class=\"s-label\">本周新增</span><span class=\"s-value\">1,024</span><span class=\"s-trend up\">↑ 12.5%</span></span></div><div class=\"variant-when\">需要与上期或目标值对比时</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">带单位<span>Unit</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><span class=\"stat-d\"><span class=\"s-label\">当前在线</span><span class=\"s-value\">3,872<small>人</small></span></span><span class=\"stat-d\"><span class=\"s-label\">存储空间</span><span class=\"s-value\">6.6<small>GB</small></span></span></div><div class=\"variant-when\">数值需要说明量纲时补充单位</div></div></div></section><section class=\"scenes\"><div class=\"section-title\">典型使用场景</div><div class=\"scene-list\"><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">数据仪表盘</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:stretch\">\n      <div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">本月销售额</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);line-height:1.3;margin-top:2px\">¥ 864,000</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--green);font-weight:600;margin-top:2px\">↑ 12.5% 较上月</div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">活跃用户</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);line-height:1.3;margin-top:2px\">12,846</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--green);font-weight:600;margin-top:2px\">↑ 8.3% 较上月</div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">退款率</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);line-height:1.3;margin-top:2px\">2.1%</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red);font-weight:600;margin-top:2px\">↓ 0.4% 较上月</div>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">运营周报</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:8px\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:13px;flex:1\">运营周报 · 第 29 周</b>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">07.13 – 07.19</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px\">\n        <div style=\"flex:1\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">新增用户</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text)\">1,024 <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--green);font-weight:600\">↑ 12.5%</span></div></div>\n        <div style=\"flex:1\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">内容发布</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text)\">386 <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--green);font-weight:600\">↑ 4.2%</span></div></div>\n        <div style=\"flex:1\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">流失率</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text)\">2.1% <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red);font-weight:600\">↑ 0.3%</span></div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">活动实时大屏</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"background:#1d2129;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center\">\n      <div style=\"flex:1.4\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.55)\">实时成交额</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;line-height:1.3;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">¥ 1,286,400</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#e3a1a5;font-weight:600;margin-top:2px\">距秒杀结束 00:12:46</div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"flex:1;border-left:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);padding-left:16px\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.55)\">当前在线</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">3,872 人</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.55);margin-top:4px\">下单 12,846 笔</div>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">账户余额</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"max-width:300px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--brand),#722ed1);border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;color:#fff\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;opacity:.75\">账户余额（元）</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:26px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">¥ 8,642.50</div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;margin-top:10px\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;opacity:.75;flex:1\">昨日收益 +12.36</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.2);border-radius:6px;padding:4px 12px\">充值</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;background:var(--bg);color:var(--brand);border-radius:6px;padding:4px 12px;margin-left:8px;font-weight:600\">提现</span>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"oil-ui-pro-recommendation\" aria-label=\"工具与支持\"><a class=\"oil-ui-pro-banner\" href=\"https://ui.oiloil.org/pro/\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"了解 oil-ui-pro 完整版：让 AI 做 UI 设计的 Agent Skill\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"/vibe-hub/source/assets/services/oil-ui-pro-banner-zh.webp\" alt=\"oil-ui-pro：把 AI 的 UI 设计能力，推到极限。完整版多了交互、布局、配图、动效和反复评审。了解完整版。\" width=\"1600\" height=\"560\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></section></div>","sourceUrl":"https://vibe-hub.org/statistic","markdown":"# 统计数值Statistic\n\n你可能会说\n首页要几个特别大的数字，比如用户数、成交额。\n\n**在首页或数据看板上突出显示人数、金额、比例等关键数字**·例如“本周订单 486，较上周增加 12%”同时告诉用户数值和比较对象。只写“↑12%”却不说明和谁相比，会让结果失去意义。\n\n## 你可以这样告诉 AI Agent\n\n> “\n> 请把本周订单做成统计数值：主值显示 486 笔，辅助信息明确“较上周增加 12%”。不要只显示箭头或百分比；同时处理无上周数据、下降和数据更新时间三种情况。\n\n### 什么时候用\n\n- **仪表盘核心指标**：销售额、活跃用户\n\n活跃用户12,846\n\n销售额¥ 86.4w\n- 带**涨跌趋势**，对比当前值与基准期\n\n本周新增1,024↑ 12.5%\n\n流失率2.1%↓ 0.4%\n- **实时数据**：在线人数、秒杀倒计时\n\n当前在线3,872人\n\n距秒杀结束00:12:46\n- **卡片里**的辅助小指标\n\n本月总结\n完成任务47\n\n获得好评98%\n\n### 什么时候不用\n\n- 展示**任务不需要的精度**，会增加理解负担\n\n转化率23.4782%展示了不必要的小数位，反而影响快速理解\n- **同一区域展示过多大数字**，会削弱重点\n\n12,846指标86.4w指标3,872指标47指标98%指标2.1%指标\n- 表达**完成进度**：使用 [进度条 **Progress**](/vibe-hub/progress?lang=zh)\n\n存储空间6.6 / 10 GB\n- 用户需要**状态结论**而非数字：使用 [标签 **Tag**](/vibe-hub/tag?lang=zh)\n\n服务可用性99.95%\n用户只想知道“正常”还是“故障”\n\n组成结构 · Anatomy\n\n本月活跃用户\n      12,846\n      ↑ 12.5% 较上月\n\n1统计数值Statistic标题 + 大数字 + 趋势的组合\n\n2指标名Label说明这是什么指标\n\n3数值Value视觉焦点，放大加粗\n\n4趋势Trend用数值、方向符号和文字说明相对上期的变化，颜色只作辅助；金融场景还要遵循当地颜色约定\n\n常见变体 · Variants\n\n基础数值Basic\n\n文章总数1,024\n\n只需展示当前值，不需要比较趋势时\n\n带趋势Trend\n\n本周新增1,024↑ 12.5%\n\n需要与上期或目标值对比时\n\n带单位Unit\n\n当前在线3,872人存储空间6.6GB\n\n数值需要说明量纲时补充单位\n\n典型使用场景\n\n数据仪表盘\n\n本月销售额\n\n        \n¥ 864,000\n\n        \n↑ 12.5% 较上月\n\n      \n活跃用户\n\n        \n12,846\n\n        \n↑ 8.3% 较上月\n\n      \n退款率\n\n        \n2.1%\n\n        \n↓ 0.4% 较上月\n\n运营周报\n\n**运营周报 · 第 29 周**\n        07.13 – 07.19\n\n      \n新增用户\n\n          \n1,024 ↑ 12.5%\n\n        \n内容发布\n\n          \n386 ↑ 4.2%\n\n        \n流失率\n\n          \n2.1% ↑ 0.3%\n\n活动实时大屏\n\n实时成交额\n\n        \n¥ 1,286,400\n\n        \n距秒杀结束 00:12:46\n\n      \n当前在线\n\n        \n3,872 人\n\n        \n下单 12,846 笔\n\n账户余额\n\n账户余额（元）\n\n      \n¥ 8,642.50\n\n      \n昨日收益 +12.36\n        充值\n        提现"}